              "instruction": "Adapt your coaching to the interaction mode. In PLOT mode: guide placement \u2014 \"Find the spot between the tick marks.\" In JUMP mode: narrate movement \u2014 \"You jumped 3 to the right, that is adding 3!\" In ORDER mode: guide comparison \u2014 \"Which number is further left? That one is smaller.\" Always reference the number line visually \u2014 point to specific tick marks and positions."
